              {
                "fontFamily": "Cambria",
                "fontSize": 11,
                "text": "Each lantern on the quay was numbered, oiled and logged by the keeper before dusk. The orchard on the northern slope produced more pears than the town could eat or trade. The bridge keeper kept a tally of crossings using a string of coloured beads.",
